id: pm-hypothesis-sweep-1114
title: Close delivered items and return idle in-progress items to open (2026-11-14 sweep)
description: Audit in-progress items against merged PR acceptance and linked issue state; reserve in_progress for active work.
type: Chore
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: "gh:unbraind/pm-hypothesis#32",maintenance,tracker-hygiene
created_at: "2026-11-14T08:53:34.930Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-22T23:58:22.333Z"
author: codex-sweep-1114
acceptance_criteria: Evidence-backed decisions for every original in-progress item; preserve live claims and append-only history; regenerate and check changelog; no new health errors.
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T08:53:47.613Z",codex-sweep-1114,"2026-11-14 sweep: inspected context, searched prior hygiene work, and read the complete tracker. Verify each in-progress item against acceptance, merged delivery, exact PR-head checks and linked issue state. Close complete delivery, reopen idle or partial work, preserve other live claims and all prior history."
  "2026-11-14T08:54:18.764Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Sweep decisions: 2 delivered items closed, 0 idle or partial items reopened, 0 canceled, 0 left alone. Evidence and remaining work are recorded per item. Linked git diff --check passed. Final tracker and changelog validation follows; release gates and hosted CI are separate evidence."
  "2026-11-14T10:09:08.997Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release-attribution correction continuation: use each delivered item's evidenced PR merge timestamp for completed_at and its first containing release tag for release. Preserve genuinely unreleased items without a release value, all statuses and existing claims. Sweep chore completion/release and reopened work are excluded. Regenerate and verify changelog placement, append-only history and health after the last write."
  "2026-11-14T10:10:00.500Z",codex-sweep-1114,"Release metadata corrected for 2 delivered items: 0 attributed to first containing tags and 2 left genuinely unreleased. Linked diff check passed. Independent timestamp/tag/changelog-placement validation and regenerated changelog checks follow this final tracker write. No review thread replies, resolutions or reactions."
  "2026-11-16T13:43:02.986Z",pi-glm,"Main synchronization: merged current main into the sweep branch, bringing the Fleet CI v2 quick/deep tier work and the pinned Daily Release adoption. The CHANGELOG conflict was resolved by taking main's release notes and regenerating them from the tracker; both delivered-item closures (issue-sync changelog, SDK envelope fitting) keep their evidenced merge SHAs and release placements. The sweep chore stays open to track this synchronization; closure is deferred to post-merge verification."
  "2026-11-16T15:18:50.616Z",codex-sol,"Continuation inspected the existing branch, remote PR head, tracker context and current GitHub delivery evidence. Preserved landed commits and existing tracker items. The branch includes current main; changelog conflicts use main before generator regeneration. Delivered PR merge timestamps and first containing release tags are rechecked. Sweep closure remains reserved for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-11-16T15:35:59.097Z",codex-sol,The tracker-only quick gate uses the repository documentation and public identity contracts. Full package npm test includes long native-state/model workloads; the initial two broader attempts were interrupted and are not passing evidence. Focused commands are linked and run to completion separately; no source coverage or full release-gate claim is made.
  "2026-11-16T15:37:44.916Z",codex-sol,"Continuation verification: npm ci passed; focused documentation/tracker tests (PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/tooling.test.ts test/automation-changelog.test.ts) passed to completion. All retained delivery rows were checked against current GitHub merge state, completion timestamps and first containing tags. No active implementation PR delivers the remaining reopened roadmap work. Both source history streams are retained in timestamp order, including original records carried by audited reanchor evidence. Final released-state tracker validation, repository changelog generation/check and identity gates run before push."
  "2026-11-16T15:42:36.924Z",codex-sol,The pinned project CLI health check sees an inherited global pm-github host-version mismatch. The compatible host pm health check passes; this environment distinction is not a hosted CI result. Clone-local merge drivers were reinstalled without changing source or workflows.
  "2026-11-22T23:51:07.424Z",codex-agent,"PRs #22 and #23 merged. Both are first contained in v2026.11.19, after v2026.10.25. Record that release explicitly before regeneration."
  "2026-11-22T23:58:20.111Z",codex-agent,"Focused linked test completed successfully. 43 pass, 0 fail, 0 skipped."
